            "level": {
              "value": 6
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You spit out a freezing breath or sonic scream. You deal 4d6 damage, plus 1d6 damage for every level you have beyond 6th, to all creatures in a 30-foot cone, with a basic Reflex save.\n\n**Awakening** Your blast powerfully batters your foes. A creature that critically fails its save is knocked prone.\n\n**Awakening** The kickback of your blast helps you make a speedy escape. When you use this ability, you Fly backward 15 feet in a straight line directly opposite your blast. This movement doesn't trigger reactions based on movement."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
